<dict>
    <key>PayloadType</key>
    <string>Configuration</string>

    <key>PayloadVersion</key>
    <integer>1</integer>

    <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
    <string>com.shrubhub.shrubdns.profile</string>

    <key>PayloadUUID</key>
    <string>2ae654b9-921f-4cf4-afa8-eff4deb5f63b</string>

    <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
    <string>ShrubDNS 🌿</string>

    <key>PayloadOrganization</key>
    <string>ShrubHub LLC</string>

    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>🛡️ A simple anti-revoke DNS for iOS sideloading.</string>

    <key>PayloadRemovalDisallowed</key>
    <false/>

    <key>ConsentText</key>
    <dict>
        <key>default</key>
        <string>⚠️ PLEASE READ THIS ENTIRE MESSAGE BEFORE INSTALLING SHRUBDNS.

🌿 Welcome to ShrubDNS!

🛡️ ShrubDNS is a simple anti-revoke DNS made for iOS sideloading. It helps prevent your sideloaded apps from getting revoked and suddenly stopping.

📱 ShrubDNS is meant to be simple: one DNS profile you install and use. It does not include the extra profiles or advanced features found in some other anti-revoke DNS setups.

⚠️ ShrubDNS can help prevent revokes, but no anti-revoke DNS can guarantee that a sideloaded app will never be revoked.

🔒 OFFICIAL SOURCE
ShrubDNS is officially distributed through the ShrubHub Discord server. If you received this profile from anywhere else, you received an unauthorized/stolen copy. For your safety, only install ShrubDNS obtained directly from ShrubHub.

💬 Support, updates, and official downloads:
https://discord.gg/Zt3cgdSvkd

🌿 Thanks for using ShrubDNS!

Copyright © 2026 ShrubHub LLC</string>
    </dict>

